#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "180\t309"
msgid "What's wrong, bro?\\nNo gas left in the tank?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa, kyoudai?\\n¿Ya te rindes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "365\t459"
msgid "You goin' down that easy!?"
msgstr "¡¿Vas a caer así de fácil?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1041\t1138"
msgid "Hey, bro..."
msgstr "Oye, kyoudai..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1143\t1203"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "¿Sí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1212\t1339"
msgid "You n' me...\\nWe've changed."
msgstr "Tú y yo...\\nHemos cambiado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1423\t1483"
msgid "Ya don't say."
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1624\t1716"
msgid "We used to burn so damn bright."
msgstr "Solíamos brillar muchísimo más en el pasado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1757\t1901"
msgid "But now, all these years..."
msgstr "Pero antes de darme cuenta, tú yo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1910\t1992"
msgid "It's turned us into a pair o' farts."
msgstr "nos convertimos en un par de vejetes."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2116\t2243"
msgid "Least now ya can keep up the Kansai act."
msgstr "Al menos ahora puedes mantener tu acento de Kansai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2328\t2426"
msgid "What, you startin' shit again?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Quieres más golpes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2456\t2516"
msgid "Relax."
msgstr "No, no es eso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2526\t2709"
msgid "Gotta say, though.\\nThis ain't how I remember ya."
msgstr "Es solo que tengo la sensación de que el tú de antes"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2710\t2818"
msgid "You used to be a hundred times stronger than that."
msgstr "era mucho, mucho más fuerte."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2878\t2960"
msgid "'Sup with that shit on your eye, anyway?"
msgstr "¿Y qué con ese parche todo raro?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2965\t3031"
msgid "That's what's holdin' ya back?"
msgstr "De seguro es por eso..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3041\t3109"
msgid "Ain't got nothin' to do with it."
msgstr "Eso no tiene nada que ver."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3143\t3297"
msgid "Been carryin' this burden 25 years now."
msgstr "Ya son 25 años con este ojo, ¿sabes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3300\t3350"
msgid "Since '85?"
msgstr "¿25 años?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3351\t3415"
msgid "Damn straight."
msgstr "Así es."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3420\t3541"
msgid "The same day old man Sasai n' I lost you..."
msgstr "El mismo día que el viejo Sasai y yo te perdimos..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3560\t3649"
msgid "That's when my peeper went, too."
msgstr "También fue el día que perdí mi ojo izquierdo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3663\t3723"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué cosa?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4083\t4195"
msgid "So, yeah.\\nThat's the thick of it."
msgstr "Y bueno,\\nasí están las cosas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4222\t4457"
msgid "Dunno, seein' 20/20 prolly <Italic>did</Italic> help.\\nDon't feel half as tough just seein' 20, y'know?"
msgstr "Puede que de hecho me haya vuelto\\nmás debilucho que cuando tenía los dos ojos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4467\t4624"
msgid "But hey, wouldn't be fair if\\nI didn't have a teensy handicap!"
msgstr "Pero como antes era fuertotote,\\nsupongo que está bien, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4679\t4739"
msgid "Brother."
msgstr "Kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4775\t4835"
msgid "That eye o' yours."
msgstr "Ese ojo tuyo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4860\t4938"
msgid "Ya lose it on my account?"
msgstr "¿Tiene que ver con lo que pasó?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5023\t5172"
msgid "You get mixed up in somethin'?\\nIs that why ya didn't show?"
msgstr "¡¿Tu ojo tiene que ver con la razón\\nde que no aparecieras ese día?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5232\t5299"
msgid "Tell me the truth, bro."
msgstr "Dime la verdad, kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5321\t5418"
msgid "That day, back in '85..."
msgstr "Ese día, en ese momento."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5435\t5525"
msgid "What kept ya from comin' to help?"
msgstr "¿Qué fue lo que te impidió ir?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5872\t5973"
msgid "That whole Ueno Seiwa hit..."
msgstr "Todo ese plan para atacar el Ueno Seiwa..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6029\t6163"
msgid "Far as I can tell,\\nit was all just a setup."
msgstr "Todo apunta a que,\\nfue probablemente orquestado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6171\t6218"
msgid "Ya ain't sure?"
msgstr "¿Probablemente?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6219\t6279"
msgid "Not 100 percent."
msgstr "No estoy seguro."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6280\t6384"
msgid "No way of findin' out now, though."
msgstr "Y aunque quisiera comprobarlo, no puedo hacerlo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6388\t6431"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr "¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6469\t6554"
msgid "The guy I'm bettin' was behind it..."
msgstr "El tipo que pudo habernos contado todo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6593\t6671"
msgid "He ain't ever gonna talk again."
msgstr "fue asesinado recientemente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6677\t6764"
msgid "Huh? Who?"
msgstr "¿Quién era ese tipo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6806\t6866"
msgid "Shibata."
msgstr "Shibata."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6912\t6976"
msgid "Kazuo Shibata."
msgstr "Kazuo Shibata."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6993\t7137"
msgid "If I'm right...\\nme, you, old man Sasai..."
msgstr "Seguro que fue él quien montó todo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7138\t7270"
msgid "He's the one who left us all to hang."
msgstr " Y le arruinó la vida al viejo Sasai, a ti, y a mí."

